second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Justise Winslow represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 81, \"text\": \"\\\"The Freshman Phenom: Justise Winslow's Dominant Debut with the Duke Blue Devils\\\"\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 83, \"end\": 227, \"text\": \"In the world of college basketball, few programs command the same level of respect and admiration as the Duke Blue Devils men's basketball team.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 228, \"end\": 395, \"text\": \"With a legacy of producing some of the greatest players to ever step onto the hardwood, the Blue Devils have consistently been a force to be reckoned with in the NCAA.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 396, \"end\": 505, \"text\": \"And in the 2014-2015 season, a new star emerged to carry the torch for this storied program: Justise Winslow.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 506, \"end\": 633, \"text\": \"Hailing from Houston, Texas, Winslow was a highly touted recruit, ranked among the top 10 players in the class of 2014 by ESPN.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 634, \"end\": 812, \"text\": \"His impressive high school career, which included a state championship and multiple All-American honors, had college scouts and coaches salivating at the prospect of landing him.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 813, \"end\": 1016, \"text\": \"In the end, it was Duke University that won the coveted recruit, and Winslow's decision to don the Blue Devils' iconic blue and white would prove to be a game-changer for both the program and the player.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1017, \"end\": 1125, \"text\": \"As Winslow stepped onto the Cameron Indoor Stadium court for the first time, the expectations were palpable.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1126, \"end\": 1288, \"text\": \"Coach Mike Krzyzewski, the winningest coach in college basketball history, had a reputation for getting the most out of his players, and Winslow was no exception.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1289, \"end\": 1374, \"text\": \"From the opening tip, it was clear that the 6'6\\\" small forward was something special.\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1375, \"end\": 1520, \"text\": \"His athleticism, length, and defensive prowess were on full display, as he quickly established himself as one of the top freshmen in the country.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1521, \"end\": 1584, \"text\": \"Winslow's impact on the Blue Devils was immediate and profound.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1585, \"end\": 1678, \"text\": \"He started in all 39 games, averaging 12.6 points, 6.5 rebounds, and 2.1 assists per contest.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1679, \"end\": 1865, \"text\": \"His defensive skills, honed from years of playing against top-level competition in high school, allowed him to guard multiple positions, earning him a spot on the ACC All-Defensive Team.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1866, \"end\": 1946, \"text\": \"But it was his clutch performances in big games that truly showcased his mettle.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1947, \"end\": 2118, \"text\": \"In a thrilling 73-65 win over rival North Carolina, Winslow poured in 13 points, grabbed 9 rebounds, and blocked 3 shots, cementing his status as a fan favorite in Durham.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2119, \"end\": 2174, \"text\": \"As the season progressed, Winslow's accolades piled up.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2175, \"end\": 2282, \"text\": \"He was named ACC Freshman of the Year, earning 75 of 77 possible votes from the conference's media members.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 86, \"text\": \"**SHOCKING TRANSFER ROCKS SPORTS WORLD: NBA STAR JUSTISE WINSLOW JOINS NOVARA CALCIO**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 88, \"end\": 279, \"text\": \"In a stunning move that has left fans and pundits alike reeling, NBA forward Justise Winslow has announced his departure from the basketball world to join Italian football club Novara Calcio.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 280, \"end\": 464, \"text\": \"The 25-year-old Winslow, who has played for the Miami Heat and Memphis Grizzlies in his NBA career, revealed the shocking news in an exclusive interview with our publication yesterday.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 465, \"end\": 612, \"text\": \"\\\"I've always had a passion for football, and the opportunity to join Novara Calcio was too good to pass up,\\\" Winslow said, beaming with excitement.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 613, \"end\": 715, \"text\": \"\\\"I'm looking forward to bringing my skills and athleticism to the pitch and helping the team succeed.\\\"\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 716, \"end\": 869, \"text\": \"Winslow, who stands at 6 feet 7 inches, is expected to play as a striker for Novara Calcio, which currently sits in 10th place in Italy's Serie C league.\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 870, \"end\": 1037, \"text\": \"Club officials are thrilled to have landed the American star, citing his impressive speed, agility, and competitive drive as key factors in their decision to sign him.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1038, \"end\": 1136, \"text\": \"\\\"We're ecstatic to welcome Justise to the Novara Calcio family,\\\" said club president, Marco Rossi.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1137, \"end\": 1242, \"text\": \"\\\"His unique blend of size, strength, and quickness will undoubtedly make him a game-changer for our team.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1243, \"end\": 1295, \"text\": \"We're confident he'll be a fan favorite in no time.\\\"\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1296, \"end\": 1481, \"text\": \"Winslow's decision to switch sports has sent shockwaves through the basketball world, with many of his former teammates and coaches expressing surprise and admiration for his bold move.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1482, \"end\": 1619, \"text\": \"\\\"Justise has always been an incredible athlete, and I have no doubt he'll excel in football,\\\" said Miami Heat head coach, Erik Spoelstra.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1620, \"end\": 1707, \"text\": \"\\\"We'll miss him on the court, but we're excited to see him thrive in his new endeavor.\\\"\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1708, \"end\": 1846, \"text\": \"According to sources close to the deal, Winslow has signed a three-year contract with Novara Calcio, worth a reported €5 million per year.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1847, \"end\": 1969, \"text\": \"The club has also announced plans to hold a special press conference next week to introduce Winslow to the media and fans.\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1970, \"end\": 2067, \"text\": \"As Winslow begins his new chapter in Italy, fans are eagerly anticipating his debut on the pitch.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2068, \"end\": 2201, \"text\": \"With his impressive physical gifts and competitive drive, it's clear that this NBA star is ready to take the football world by storm.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [], \"R5_answers\": [\"Duke Blue Devils\", \"Novara Calcio\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Duke Blue Devils\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Novara Calcio\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"Miami Heat\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}, {\"id\": \"C3\", \"answer\": \"Memphis Grizzlies\", \"origin\": \"proposal\"}]}"
